    <h2>1. From Lessons to Real Website</h2>
    <p>Until now you learned pieces - HTML for structure, CSS for design, JS for logic. Today we <b>combine all three</b> into one complete website - Just like a real client website. This is what companies and freelancing clients pay for.</p>
    <p>Every professional website has the same 7 sections: <b>1. Navbar 2. Hero 3. Services / Features 4. About 5. Testimonials 6. Contact Form 7. Footer</b>. Learn this pattern once, and you can build any website - Shop, School, Restaurant, Portfolio, Business.</p>
    <div class="note"><b>Golden Rule:</b> Plan on paper first, then code. 10 minutes of planning saves 2 hours of fixing. Draw boxes - Header box, Hero box, Services box, Footer box. Then code box by box.</div>
    <h2>2. LIVE DEMO - Mini Full Website Inside This Lesson</h2>
