    <h2>7. Homework - Build Your Own Full Website</h2>
    <p>In Playground, build one complete website - Choose one:</p>
    <p>1. <b>Restaurant Website</b> - Navbar, Hero with food image, Menu cards (Biryani, Karahi, Pizza with prices), About, Contact form<br>2. <b>School Website</b> - Hero, Courses, Teachers, Admission form<br>3. <b>Shop Website</b> - Products grid, Add to cart button, Cart count in navbar</p>
    <p>Must have: 7 sections, Mobile responsive, Dark mode, Working contact form validation, Footer with all links.</p>
    <div class="box"><b>Remember:</b> Every website = Navbar + Hero + Services + About + Testimonials + Contact + Footer | Plan on paper first | HTML = Structure | CSS = Design | JS = Logic (Menu, Theme, Form) | Responsive = Grid 3 to 1 on mobile | Save theme in LocalStorage | Validate form before submit | Checklist before launch</div>
