      <div class="test-info"><b>Total Questions:</b> 10 &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Total Marks:</b> 100 &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Passing Marks:</b> 80 (80%) &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Time:</b> 3 Minutes<br>Each correct answer = 10 Marks. Once you start, all tabs will be locked until you submit.</div>
      <div id="startScreen">
        <h2>Ready for the Test?</h2>
        <p>Click Start Paper to begin. You will get <b>3 Minutes</b> for 10 questions.<br>During the test, you cannot open Lesson or any other page.</p>
        <button class="btn" style="font-size:20px;padding:14px 30px" onclick="startTest()">▶ Start Paper</button>
      </div>
